{
 "priority": 2,
 "source_bins": [
  "sound_auth.bin",
  "talk.bin"
 ],
 "strings": {
  "And who better to fill them than former Ministry of Health\nexecs? They'd never have to worry about finding employment again.": "",
  "Because of you, the Ministry of Health execs had security.\nTheir futures were guaranteed.": "",
  "It was a crafty move, Ichinose-san.": "",
  "One I'm sure the Ministry leadership loved you for.\nI can see why you ended up vice minister.": "",
  "However...\nThe good times didn't last forever.": "",
  "However... nothing lasts forever.": "",
  "In the months and years after its founding, people slowly\ncaught on to the Medical Institute's total lack of output.": "",
  "Eventually, people caught on to the\nMedical Institute's total lack of output.": "",
  "And with the country in a recession,\nthey started zeroing in on the Institute's funding.": "",
  "When the recession hit, they started\nzeroing in on the Institute's funding.": "",
  "The vast amounts of money being poured into supporting\nit seemed like nothing more than a waste.": "",
  "The vast amounts of money being poured into it\nseemed practically wasteful.": "",
  "Before long, closing the Institute outright didn't seem out of the question.\nPlans were even set in motion to redevelop the land once it was gone.": "",
  "Rumor had it that Minister Kazami had\nactually approved those plans internally.": "",
  "I hear Minister Kazami gave the okay\non those plans personally.": "",
  "Hmph. Are all your arguments\ngoing to be based on hearsay?": "",
  "Hmph. Is that your argument?\nAll of this is based on hearsay?": "",
  "Speaking of hearsay. Kamurocho's been buzzing with talk\nof this murderer who gouges people's eyes out.": "",
  "Let's talk about hearsay. Kamurocho's been buzzing about\nthis murderer who gouges people's eyes out.": "",
  "That killer is an assassin\nI've termed \"the Mole.\"": "",
  "But the truth of it is, those murders are the result of human experiments\nfor AD-9, carried out in a secret lab in the heart of the city.": "",
  "In truth, those murders are the result of human\nexperiments for AD-9. Carried out in a secret lab in Kamurocho.": "",
  "This is all purely gossip.": "",
  "This is tabloid sensationalism.": "",
  "Members of the jury. AD-9's development is about\nto enter the clinical trial phase.": "",
  "AD-9's pretty far along now.\nThey're about to enter the clinical trial phase.": "",
  "However, ADDC researchers...": "",
  "...Have already carried out clinical trials behind\nclosed doors. Several people have died as a result.": "",
  "...have already carried out closed door clinical trials.\nAs a result, several have died.": "",
  "Of course, they tried to keep that a secret...\nBut it eventually found its way out.": "",
  "Of course, that was top secret.\nBut... the truth is starting to leak to outsiders.": "",
  "And I have the evidence to prove it.": "",
  "And I have evidence to prove that.\nRight here, in this courtroom.": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(The ADDC's secrets were leaked to an outsider.\nWhat evidence shows that?)</color>": "",
  "The victim in this case, Shintani-sensei,\nwas inching ever closer to the truth.": "",
  "The victim in this case, Shintani-sensei, came across a piece of info\nconnected to the top secret human experiments.": "",
  "That's why he called the ADDC.\nIsn't that right, Ichinose-san?": "",
  "That's why the ADDC appears in his call history.\nAm I wrong, Ichinose-san?": "",
  "Not long before his death, Shintani-sensei was told a secret by Captain\nHamura of the Matsugane Family. A secret that led him right to the ADDC.": "",
  "Shintani-sensei heard a secret, from a yakuza\nnamed Hamura of the Matsugane Family.": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(The secret Shintani heard\nfrom Hamura was...)</color>": "",
  "It was a secret about the death of Hashiki,\nthe former vice director of the ADDC.": "",
  "What Shintani-sensei heard was about the murder\nof Hashiki-san, the vice-director of the ADDC...?": "",
  "At least, I think it was.": "",
  "I think it was, at least.": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Wait, is that how it went?)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(I messed up. I have to start from the beginning.)</color>": "",
  "Apologies.\nIf you'll allow me to start again.": "",
  "ADDC researchers were carrying out clinical trials behind closed\ndoors in order to speed up the development of AD-9.": "",
  "The ADDC was carrying out dangerous human experiments\nin order to complete AD-9.": "",
  "However, whispers of that secret started to\nleak to outsiders.": "",
  "And I have evidence to prove that.\nRight here, in this very courtroom.": "",
  "This secret was about\nCaptain Hamura's own livelihood.": "",
  "What Shintani-sensei heard from Hamura\nwas about his work for the Matsugane Family.": "",
  "The truth of it was, the Matsugane Family,\na Tojo Clan subsidiary, was killing people for money.": "",
  "That the Matsugane Family, a Tojo Clan\nyakuza organization, was killing people for money.": "",
  "Hm? I thought this was about the ADDC.": "",
  "Hm...? But... wasn't the secret Shintani-sensei learned\nsupposed to be about the ADDC?    ": "",
  "What you just said would be more pertinent\nto the Matsugane Family...": "",
  "Unless it's your intention to\nindict the Matsugane Family?": "",
  "Wait, uh...": "",
  "This secret was that the data published\nin the AD-9 research had been falsified.": "",
  "What Shintani-sensei heard from Hamura\nwas that the data for AD-9 was falsified.": "",
  "What!? Really?": "",
  "That's quite a bold assertion.\nDo you have any evidence that can prove it, though?": "",
  "AD-9's data was being falsified?\nWhat evidence proves that?": "",
  "This secret was that someone from the ADDC was connected\nto the serial murders taking place in Kamurocho.": "",
  "What Shintani-sensei heard from Hamura... was that someone at the ADDC\nhad a connection to the serial murders in Kamurocho.": "",
  "And so, Shintani-sensei called the Center\nand asked specifically for a researcher named Shono.": "",
  "And so, Shintani-sensei placed a call to the ADDC,\nand asked for a man named Shono.": "",
  "The man spearheading\nthe AD-9 human experiments.": "",
  "This Shono... is the one leading\nAD-9's human experiments.": "",
  "Hm? What is this supposed to show...?": "",
  "Were you not going to prove the victim was close to\ndiscovering the Center's secret?": "",
  "I was, Your Honor. Just making sure you were paying\nattention.": "",
  "Yagami-san, come on...": "",
  "Come on, Yagami-san...": "",
  "I think this is it.": "",
  "You... think? Are you absolutely certain?": "",
  "You think...?\nIs the counsel... absolutely certain?": "",
  "Here. This piece of evidence is what first led us\nto look into the ADDC.": "",
  "Please elaborate to the jury\nwhat exactly you mean by that.": "",
  "Counsel, please elaborate\non these implications.": "",
  "On the day of his death, the victim, Shintani-sensei,\nmade a phone call to someone at the ADDC.": "",
  "That someone was a man named Shono.": "",
  "Shono-sensei is the lead researcher on AD-9, and is thought to be\nthe one responsible for the human experiments I mentioned earlier.": "",
  "Enough of this nonsense!": "",
  "Human experimentation!?\nDon't be ridiculous!": "",
  "What kind of trial is being run here? How can he say\nwhatever he wants without a single piece of evidence?": "",
  "What kind of trial is this!?\nHe hasn't even presented credible proof!": "",
  "Why doesn't the prosecution stop him!?": "",
  "Why doesn't the prosecution object!?": "",
  "Sorry, I was enjoying hearing\nwhat he had to say.": "",
  "You must admit, it's entertaining.": "",
  "Have you lost your mind?": "",
  "What...? Have you lost your mind?": "",
  "Ichinose-san. I'm not finished\nwith my line of questioning.": "",
  "Witness... I'm not finished with\nmy line of questioning.": "",
  "Actually, it's more of a confirmation\nthan a question.": "",
  "Well, it's more of a confirmation\nthan a question.": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Time to go for the kill.)</color>": "",
  "Do you know who Shinpei Okubo is?": "",
  "Yes. He's the murderer\nyou set free three years ago.": "",
  "Yes. He's the murderer you set free\nthree years ago.": "",
  "I set him free, yes.\nBut he's not a murderer.": "",
  "No... He's no murderer.": "",
  "The one who actually killed\nWaku-san and Emi Terasawa...": "",
  "Three years ago, the one who actually killed\nWaku-san and Emi Terasawa...": "",
  "...Was the same Shono\nI mentioned earlier.": "",
  "This garbage again!?": "",
  "Don't act like you don't already know all of this.\nYou're just not coming clean.": "",
  "Don't act like you don't already know all this.\nYou're just stalling.": "",
  "Even though Okubo-kun's sitting on death row,\nwaiting for the day they decide it's his turn.": "",
  "Okubo-kun's an innocent man on death row,\nwaiting to die.": "",
  "Enough. I was only asked here to explain to the jury\nabout AD-9 and the ADDC.": "",
  "How dare you treat me like this!?": "",
  "You and Shono hired\nthe Mole to murder for you!": "",
  "You lied, murdered, and conspired for\nyour human experiments!": "",
  "That was the only way you'd have \"patients\"\nfor your underground human experiments.": "",
  "And because you thought you could... you and Shono\nhired the Mole to kidnap your victims.": "",
  "And all to protect the interests of AD-9.": "",
  "All to protect the interests of AD-9.": "",
  "You can't make these claims without proof!\nShow me your evidence!": "",
  "Show me a shred of evidence that\nsupports these baseless claims!": "",
  "Just the other day...\nSomeone reached out to me over in Kamurocho.": "",
  "Just the other day... someone reached out to me\nover in Kamurocho.": "",
  "They wanted to entrust me with\na crucial piece of information.": "",
  "They entrusted me with something...\na crucial piece of information.": "",
  "This is the bullet found\nin Shintani-sensei's chest.": "",
  "This is the bullet that was found\nin Shintani-sensei's body.": "",
  "Shintani-sensei was murdered because\nof what he knew about the human experiments.": "",
  "Shintani-sensei was murdered because he knew too much.\nHe knew vital information, with the power to reveal the human experiments.": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(That piece of information was...)</color>": "",
  "He knew all about the serial murders\ntaking place in Kamurocho...": "",
  "Shintani-sensei knew about the serial murders\ngoing on in Kamurocho...": "",
  "And that someone at the ADDC\nwas deeply involved.": "",
  "...And that someone at the ADDC\nwas involved.": "",
  "And so, Shintani-sensei\nhad to be silenced.": "",
  "And when the ADDC found out about that,\nthey silenced Shintani-sensei.": "",
  "You need some evidence if you're going to accuse\nthe ADDC of murdering Shintani-sensei.": "",
  "If you believe the ADDC is culpable for Shintani-sensei's death,\nyou'll need some evidence to back that up.": "",
  "And from the way you're grasping at straws,\nit doesn't sound like you have it.": "",
  "From what you've been saying,\nI don't think you have that.": "",
  "Oh... right.": "",
  "Huh? Really?": "",
  "This is a photo of Shintani-sensei's corpse.": "",
  "The Mole murdered him to keep the information\nhe knew from getting out.": "",
  "Shintani-sensei learned some information about the human experiments.\nSo the Mole killed him, and gouged his eyes out.": "",
  "This is the bullet extracted\nfrom Shintani-sensei's chest.": "",
  "This is the bullet that was extracted\nfrom Shintani-sensei's body.": "",
  "The rifling marks confirm it was fired\nfrom Detective Ayabe's handgun.": "",
  "Based on the rifling marks, it was indeed fired\nfrom the gun of the defendant, Detective Ayabe.": "",
  "As for how that connects to Shintani-sensei's\nknowledge of the experiments... Well... Um...": "",
  "You may well ask: how do the rifling marks connect to\nthe victim's knowledge of human experiments...? Uh... good question.": "",
  "Consider the research paper on AD-9,\nthe dream drug said to be a cure for dementia.": "",
  "The announcement of a supposed cure for Alzheimer's...\nThe research paper on AD-9.": "",
  "Dr. Kido of the ADDC presented\nthese findings to the world.": "",
  "Dr. Kido of the ADDC presented\nthis paper to the world.": "",
  "As for how that connects to Shintani-sensei's knowledge\nof the experiments... Well... It uh...": "",
  "Perhaps you're wondering, how does this paper connect to\nthe victim's knowledge of human experiments...? Uh... How <font_kind=yakuza_italic>do</font_kind> they?": "",
  "Your Honor.\nI offer the data I received into evidence.": "",
  "Your Honor. I offer the data\nI received into evidence.": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Wait, was this it?)</color>": "",
  "Take a listen to this.": "",
  "Did you tell someone about Shono?": "",
  "That lawyer, Shintani.\nWord has it he just called the ADDC.": "",
  "That lawyer, Shintani. Word has it\nhe just called the ADDC.": "",
  "Well, uh... yeah I might've\nsaid something. But it's fine.": "",
  "Well, uh... I might've said something.\nBut Shintani's no threat.": "",
  "Shintani'll keep quiet if I tell him to.": "",
  "He'll keep quiet if I tell him to.": "",
  "How can you be so naive!?\nThis is unacceptable!": "",
  "You must deal with this, Hamura-san.\nImmediately.": "",
  "This is your mess to clean up.": "",
  "Do what needs to be done.\nHave Kuroiwa-san handle the dirty details.": "",
  "Hamura-san. Do what needs to be done.\nHave Kuroiwa-san handle the dirty details.": "",
  "It'll cost you another hundred mil.": "",
  "This mistake was yours and yours alone.\nDon't anger me further.": "",
  "This mistake was <font_kind=yakuza_italic>yours</font_kind> and yours alone.\nFix it, and don't anger me further.": "",
  "It's Yagami. I'm almost back in the city.\nAny idea where Kuroiwa is?": "",
  "It's me. I'm almost back in Kamurocho.\nMafuyu... any idea where Kuroiwa is?": "",
  "Not yet. We're having trouble\ngetting in touch with him.": "",
  "Don't know yet.\nI can't reach him...": "",
  "Oh, and... I'm not sure if this is related,\nbut there's been a shooting in Theater Square.": "",
  "I wonder if Kuroiwa is involved somehow...": "",
  "Yes. I wonder if Kuroiwa\nis involved somehow...": "",
  "(I need to head to Theater Square.)": "",
  "Kaito-san and Higashi-san'll be okay!\nWe've gotta get after Kuroiwa!": "",
  "That bastard...\nThere's nothing he won't do.": "",
  "That goddamn Kuroiwa...\nThere's nothing he won't do.": "",
  "Dammit, the door's not opening!\nIt's locked!": "",
  "Locked...?": "",
  "Hm. When I was here with Emi-chan...": "",
  "I remember when I was here\nwith Emi-chan...": "",
  "That's the research wing where they\ndevelop all our new drugs.": "",
  "That's the research wing\nwhere they develop all our new drugs.": "",
  "You can't get in without\na gold keycard, though.": "",
  "We need a gold keycard!\nLet's find one!": "",
  "Security system activated.": "",
  "An emergency situation has occurred.\nActivating security system.": "",
  "Three minutes to full lockdown. ": "",
  "Security measures are now activating.\nThree minutes until total gate lockdown.": "",
  "Two minutes to full lockdown.": "",
  "Security activation in progress.\nTwo minutes until gate lockdown.": "",
  "One minute to full lockdown.": "",
  "Security activation in progress.\nOne minute until gate lockdown.": "",
  "Lockdown engaged.": "",
  "Locking gate.": "",
  "(What!? Seriously!? I gotta hurry!)": "",
  "We're lookin' for a gold one, right?\nDammit, this one's not what we want.": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(It's a police baton. I don't think I could\nget the gate down with this.)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Must've been a quick death.\nKuroiwa, that bastard...)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(The cervical spine is broken.\nDeath had to have been instant.)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Hm...)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(A gold keycard! This is it!\nThis'll open the gate to the research wing!)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(This is just a regular key.\nGuess he doesn't have a keycard.)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Nope, just a watch.)</color>": "",
  "Sorry buddy, I need to borrow this for a bit.": "",
  "Sorry, man.": "",
  "I found one!\nWe can get through the gate!": "",
  "I found one!\nWe can get through.": "",
  "Look, on the skyway!": "",
  "Look out there!": "",
  "That bastard's murdering them!": "",
  "He straight up shot them!": "",
  "We've gotta put an end to this!": "",
  "Dammit, let's get after him!": "",
  "Good to see you again, detective!": "",
  "You're, uh... Mashiko, right?": "",
  "Mashiko-san, wasn't it?": "",
  "You little shit!": "",
  "You little shit...!": "",
  "You again? Just keep drawing\nthe short straw, huh?": "",
  "Man, you're goin' up against us again?\nYou just keep getting the short straw, huh?": "",
  "Don't give me your snark, punk!\nYou're done for!": "",
  "I dunno how long I can keep doing this...\nBut we can't stop. Not now.": "",
  "I dunno how long I can keep doing this...\nBut we can't stop now.": "",
  "Yagami-san! What's wrong!?": "",
  "Whoa... you okay?": "",
  "Just... a little dizzy...": "",
  "I'm just... a little dizzy...": "",
  "Are you okay, Yagami-san?\nYou're, uh... You're kinda bleeding a lot.": "",
  "Are you okay, Yagami-san?\nYou're, uh... kinda bleeding a lot.": "",
  "Dunno. I'm not seeing the light at the end\nof the tunnel just yet, though.": "",
  "Dunno...\nBut I'm not going into the light yet.": "",
  "Heh, maybe you're better than you look.\nC'mon, let's go.": "",
  "Wh-What the...!?": "",
  "G-Gah! What the...!?": "",
  "Why is there a body in here...?": "",
  "A... body...? Why is it here...?": ""
 },
 "ref_tm": {
  "Huh? Really?": "หืม จริงเหรอ",
  "You little shit!": "ไอ้เวรเอ๊ย!",
  "You little shit...!": "ไอ้เด็กระยำ...!"
 }
}
